sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant You
    participant Ona as Ona (coordinator)
    participant Board as Coordination board
    participant Mara
    participant Cole
    participant Sam
    You->>Ona: Prepare the Spring Sale launch pack
    Ona->>Board: workflow_start + task_decomposition (3 tasks)
    par each delegate works its part
        Ona->>Mara: task 1 · confirm the offer
        Mara->>Board: task_start … task_completion
    and
        Ona->>Cole: task 2 · write the announcement
        Cole->>Board: task_start … task_completion
    and
        Ona->>Sam: task 3 · three customer answers
        Sam->>Board: task_start … task_completion
    end
    Note over Mara,Sam: All three read the same shared memory while they work.
    Ona->>Board: workflow_complete
    Ona-->>You: one combined launch pack
